OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency department use up 68%   
OL,4,Asince 2019                             
OL,6,FGuernsey's emergency department is     
OL,7,Fexpected to be used 11,000 more times  
OL,8,Fthis year than it was in 2019.         
OL,10,FAttendance was 16,000 seven years ago  
OL,11,Fand is expected to reach 27,000 by the 
OL,12,Fend of 2026.                           
OL,14,FGeorge Oswald, president of Health and 
OL,15,FSocial Care, said: "It's a reflection  
OL,16,Fof the way people choose to encounter  
OL,17,Fand seek medical care."                
OL,19,FThe service was "a victim of its own   
OL,20,Fsuccess", he added.                    
